<i>…di supporto per tutto il quartiere.</i>

220
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,040
Grazie mille.

221
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,360
Eric.

222
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,440
Ciao, zia.

223
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:33,440
Ciao.

224
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,360
Stai bene?

225
